      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of pressure and emptiness, and it's completely understandable that you feel exhausted. That feeling of being a hollow shell amidst all the achievements is a profound and painful experience. Please know that feeling lost when the external markers of success don't align with your inner self is a very common, though deeply isolating, human struggle. Consider allowing yourself a moment to just acknowledge that exhaustion before trying to figure out what comes next.",
